//   - docs/release-check/PC_Tracker_Release_Check.pdf  the printable version
//   - .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/release-check.md  the GitHub issue version
// Each check: id (never change one once answers were saved under it), title, do (the steps),
// see (what you should see), optional why and timing (a "seconds" box), and optional: true for a check
// that can wait (the page's "Essentials" view hides it; the PDF and the GitHub issue mark it). Every other
// check is an ESSENTIAL: done before any school gets the version.
// Round 2 (2026-11-14): fixed: "what changed" on a check that had a problem or a note in round 1 (the page
// marks it "Fixed, re-test"); breakit: true = a "Try to break it" test (its own "Show" view, never counted
// as an essential); lastRound = round 1's answers, shown on each check as "Last time".
// Writing: plain short sentences, the sheet's own words, no em dashes.

